@MakeMeEggs Not when they release but after. SoFi releases its 10Q about a week after the earnings call. The Earnings Call is useless. You need the actual 10Q filing which is filed with the SEC to get anything of substance.

It's kinda the difference between you seeing the Doctor and he gives a diagnosis based on symptoms but he won't give a full explanation until he sees the bloodwork. I'm the same way, I need the bloodwork (10Q), the rest is irrelevant. 

Once they file the 10Q, I will update and release a new video. 👍🏼

